  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Acumen Resilient Agriculture Fund (ARAF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARAF is a climate change adaptation focused fund designed to finance early stage micro-, small and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs) serving smallholder farmers in three African countries.

&#x2022; GCF plays a catalytic role in launching a first of its kind adaptation-focused agriculture fund in Africa benefiting smallholder farmers through innovative private social entrepreneurs.
&#x2022; Partnership with GCF has shifted the focus of Acumen towards investment in climate change mitigation and adaptation.
&#x2022; It contributes to developing a toolkit to monitor adaptation impact from the farmers&#x2019; perspective and building quantitative and qualitative adaptation impact data to be shared with green impact investment communities.</narrative>
  </description>
